{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「天王嫂」方媛（Moka）2017年與大她22歲的天王郭富城結婚，婚後育有3名可愛女兒，一家五口生活幸福愉快。郭富城忙於杭州《ICONIC》世界巡迴演唱會，方媛獨自帶9歲大女兒郭詠希、7歲二女兒郭詠萱，回安徽蕪湖南陵縣外婆家度暑假。有人見到方媛除了陪外婆外，更在古鎮影相宣傳，作風親民。</p><figure><img alt=\"郭富城與方媛慶祝結婚9周年。(方媛小紅書)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260419/1122496397267439616975632.jpeg/9IoDJ0lfJ_oLGOZNBb5ptPJniOv6hr0Fq4PFFKuDxRQ\"/><figcaption>郭富城與方媛慶祝結婚9周年。(方媛小紅書)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「天王嫂」方媛參與內地真人騷《五十公里桃花塢6》惹熱議。（微博@方媛Moka）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133034337747341312759423.jpeg/Vx8rm__VMbyL0eCAn8I221Y4kEkaMu_c-KNWyPijVsg\"/><figcaption>「天王嫂」方媛參與內地真人騷《五十公里桃花塢6》惹熱議。（微博@方媛Moka）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"方媛罕有參加內地真人騷《五十公里桃花塢6》。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260525/1135613209449861120213765.jpeg/HXDfENEFBcHjwnqyqHeFCkjgeOD6FOLwsnbWUbJ21lE\"/><figcaption>方媛罕有參加內地真人騷《五十公里桃花塢6》。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>方媛安徽陪外婆行古鎮打卡</p><p>日前有網民在安徽見到方媛陪外婆行街。方媛戴上太陽眼鏡，溫柔拖住外婆一邊行商場一邊聊天，非常孝順。方媛穿上低調白T恤，背影身形姣好，即使身為三孩之母，方媛亦Keep到身材纖瘦又有線條。</p><p>其後又有網民在當地古鎮見到方媛打扮得靚靚，獨自行古鎮，並到不同餐廳一嘗家鄉美食兼打卡。方媛對住鏡頭大啖美食，並擺出不同可愛Pose，相信是宣傳家鄉文化。方媛親切大方與鄉里影相，絲毫沒有天王嫂架子，有網民稱讚方媛帶動家鄉經濟，值得欣賞。</p><figure><img alt=\"方媛與外婆行街。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128779712237568172534.png/rOZb3IxdLiOyIZiYAKwnWAmCW2hUyP3IpIAQUaSAEFE\"/><figcaption>方媛與外婆行街。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"背影身形姣好。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128777455570944564912.png/7BGYSi6psFOT6lxmsBlifz9v1kcSZcy2p9hi8KfYYvA\"/><figcaption>背影身形姣好。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好孝順。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128775517671424950174.png/1VGX-kCJj2UtulnbfTtK9b-JHlHBRISGp73tBKe97QQ\"/><figcaption>好孝順。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"方媛獨自一人到當地古鎮打卡。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128773244227584156843.png/ORWMA5xoOkhhlHAtqIU0UHOu-_5AlCn8pc0bb6XNG28\"/><figcaption>方媛獨自一人到當地古鎮打卡。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"嘆美食。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128770924646400378695.png/5V58V5BEXXXcl_m1NpOhiGMdyI1KTLHUPrLwBD6y8AQ\"/><figcaption>嘆美食。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"嘆美食。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128782950240256984150.png/1h4Gvy83t41M9IvnTeeklBvcP888MlQjqrQ0xKq0NMQ\"/><figcaption>嘆美食。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"打卡。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128780643241984972483.png/yutZP-lxusXdwepgsCnC-QY3xUG968ENEssDvBLLA7w\"/><figcaption>打卡。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"作風親民。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128778466267136927053.png/B64ItB9vCTpr25TmlUEqyO2ESiw0hhahKgArGSoAKxk\"/><figcaption>作風親民。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"作風親民。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128776209600512067328.png/43dM7OECJuF2bRitIAnktCVpodNbY4WnMhUrmjIVK5o\"/><figcaption>作風親民。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260809/1163128773814521856591683.png/HoDLyZe0K-RH48PIVRwKZJqQvHEZWg2WPz5L0j8-S9I\"/><figcaption>靚！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-09T09:21:26.093607+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":573,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}